Game assets
-----------

The Old School RuneScape art, models, animations, sounds, fonts and other game
content are the property of Jagex Ltd. They are not included in this
repository and are not covered by its license. The bake (scripts/bake) decodes
them on your own machine from the game cache published by the OpenRS2 Archive
(https://archive.openrs2.org), and fetches RuneStar's TrueType conversions of
the game's fonts (https://github.com/RuneStar/fonts). RuneStar dedicates its
conversion to the public domain under CC0 1.0; the glyph designs are Jagex's.

A few small data files generated from the cache stay in the repository
because the server and the build need them: the bank's collision grid and
object placements (shared/collision.json, shared/world-meta.json) and the
character designer's option counts (src/game/osrs/catalog.generated.ts).

